******************************************

To start the project, you need to do three things:

Start Frontend: (Inside frontend, open a terminal and type this)
=> npm start

(Check: http://localhost:3000/)

Start Virtual Environment: (Inside the guru-platform, open a terminal and type this)
=> source venv/bin/activate


Start Backend: (After starting virtual environment or inside venv, type this)
=> ollama serve &
=> uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000

(Check: http://127.0.0.1:8000/)

*******************************************

For deactivating the virtual environment(Venv)
=> deactivate

********************************************

Useful Docker commands to remember
Stop Qdrant           =>	docker stop qdrant
Start it again later  =>	docker start qdrant
Check if running      =>	docker ps
Check all containers (including stopped)  => 	docker ps -a
Delete the container entirely             =>	docker rm qdrant

